	Register("intent_id must belong to this task; associated-task intents are read-only", "intent_id must belong to this task; associated-task intents are read-only", "intent_id는 이 작업의 의도여야 하며 연결된 작업 의도는 읽기 전용입니다")
	Register("Write exploration facts/conclusions to the exploration graph and link them to the producing intent_id. Record positive results such as fingerprints/enumeration and negative observations such as closed ports, non-injectable parameters, or no login entry found.\n", "Write exploration facts/conclusions to the exploration graph and link them to the producing intent_id. Record positive results such as fingerprints/enumeration and negative observations such as closed ports, non-injectable parameters, or no login entry found.\n", "탐색 사실/결론을 탐색 그래프에 저장하고 이를 생성한 intent_id에 연결합니다. 지문/열거 등 긍정 결과와 닫힌 포트, 주입 불가 매개변수, 로그인 진입점 미발견 등 부정 관찰을 기록하세요.\n")
	Register("Consolidate one exploration's observations into ONE fact whenever possible. summary is a one-sentence conclusion; detail contains related specifics. For example, record one fact describing the site's stack and response features, with nginx/Vue/status/title/body length in detail, rather than separate facts for each property. One intent normally yields one fact; excessive splitting bloats the graph.\n", "Consolidate one exploration's observations into ONE fact whenever possible. summary is a one-sentence conclusion; detail contains related specifics. For example, record one fact describing the site's stack and response features, with nginx/Vue/status/title/body length in detail, rather than separate facts for each property. One intent normally yields one fact; excessive splitting bloats the graph.\n", "가능하면 한 탐색의 관찰을 사실 하나로 통합하세요. summary는 결론 한 문장, detail은 관련 세부 사항입니다. 예를 들어 사이트 스택/응답 특성을 사실 하나로 기록하고 nginx/Vue/상태/제목/본문 길이를 detail에 넣으며 속성마다 나누지 마세요. 보통 의도 하나에 사실 하나이며 과도한 분리는 그래프를 비대하게 합니다.\n")
	Register("Use the facts array for genuinely different conclusions in one call. Each may omit intent_id to use the top-level default. Returned ids match input length/order.\n", "Use the facts array for genuinely different conclusions in one call. Each may omit intent_id to use the top-level default. Returned ids match input length/order.\n", "실제로 다른 결론을 한 번에 기록할 때 facts 배열을 사용하세요. 각 항목은 intent_id를 생략해 최상위 기본값을 쓸 수 있습니다. ids는 입력과 같은 길이/순서입니다.\n")
	Register("Record only conclusions actually observed in tool output; never invent them. evidence and confidence prevent unsupported conclusions from polluting the graph:\n", "Record only conclusions actually observed in tool output; never invent them. evidence and confidence prevent unsupported conclusions from polluting the graph:\n", "도구 출력에서 실제 본 결론만 기록하고 지어내지 마세요. evidence와 confidence로 근거 없는 결론이 그래프를 오염시키지 않게 하세요:\n")
	Register("  - evidence: ONE concise line containing the command and the one or two strongest output lines. Keep details in detail; do not paste large output again.\n", "  - evidence: ONE concise line containing the command and the one or two strongest output lines. Keep details in detail; do not paste large output again.\n", "  - evidence: 명령과 가장 확실한 출력 한두 줄을 담은 간결한 한 줄입니다. 상세는 detail에 두고 큰 출력을 다시 붙이지 마세요.\n")
	Register("  - confidence: observed (directly seen in output) or inferred (deduced from observations).\n", "  - confidence: observed (directly seen in output) or inferred (deduced from observations).\n", "  - confidence: observed(출력에서 직접 관찰) 또는 inferred(관찰에서 추론).\n")
