	Register("Use for multiple distinct conclusions. Each fact has summary/detail/evidence/confidence/intent_id/asset_ids; omitted intent_id uses the top-level value. Returned ids match input length/order.", "Use for multiple distinct conclusions. Each fact has summary/detail/evidence/confidence/intent_id/asset_ids; omitted intent_id uses the top-level value. Returned ids match input length/order.", "서로 다른 결론이 여러 개일 때 사용하세요. 각 사실은 summary/detail/evidence/confidence/intent_id/asset_ids를 가지며 intent_id 생략 시 최상위 값을 씁니다. ids는 같은 길이/순서입니다.")
